      "writtenOn": "2018-09-28T09:57:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will not add a callback, it will overwrite any existing one. It\u0027s fine, but then you normally call this \"setNetdUnsolicitedEventCallback\" instead of \"add\" because \"add\" suggests you can have multiple of them set for each type.",
